    "source_text": "A solution of diacetoxypalladium (10.87 mg, 0.05 mmol) and dicyclohexyl(2',6'-diisopropoxy-[1,1'-biphenyl]-2-yl)phosphine (45.2 mg, 0.10 mmol) dissolved in toluene (3 mL) was degassed and heated to 50°C for 30 minutes before adding ethyl piperidine-4-carboxylate (0.105 mL, 0.68 mmol), 5-bromo-2-chloro-4-methylpyridine (100 mg, 0.48 mmol) and sodium 2-methylpropan-2-olate (74.5 mg, 0.77 mmol) under nitrogen. The mixture was heated to 100°C for 2 hours.    LCMS indicated little product so reaction abandoned.  ",
